  <verbatim|Lean/YM/FullVolume/Cross.lean>>|<cell|<verbatim|Ahead> is an
  <verbatim|Unlatched> continuation. <verbatim|Unlatched> universally
  quantifies over bolt, nesting, schedule, transfers and doors, and asks for
  making, climbing and freight data. <verbatim|Run> stores exactly these
