  <verbatim|ShowHours.canvas>, and <verbatim|ShowHours.oldPrices> are the
  selected storefront, room-test and table-ready inputs used with the same
  launch pane in <verbatim|earn_epoch>. It returns survivors on <verbatim|C>.
  <verbatim|bush_start> uses the same <verbatim|ShowHours>, Launch, survivor,
  making data, and the selected family's Wilson-running estimate; the Launch
  corridor is passed through the construction. <verbatim|Coupons> consumes
